# Conventions for reference material

- Use descriptive filenames (like `protocol-reference.md`)
- Keep documents focused on a single topic
- Prefer structured formats (tables, definition lists) over prose for lookup-oriented content
- Update or remove documents when the referenced technology or specification changes
